[node name="StoryItems" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="LetterRack" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(640, -660)
script = ExtResource("6_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the letter rack"
flag_to_set = "wren_letter_rack_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]Old Wren's letter rack[/b]

Behind the counter is a wall of pigeonholes, each chalked with a destination: THORNHAVEN, GREYSTONE, ASHGUARD, BRACKENMOOR, THE CAPITOL, PALACE HILL. Couriers leave their bags with Wren overnight, and she keeps them dry.

Look closer and some of the seals sit a little proud of the paper, as if they had been lifted with a warm knife and pressed down again. In the CAPITOL slot lies a letter from Thornhaven in plain brown wax with no crest, addressed in a careful hand to the Merchants' Guildhall, 'for the lady's attention.'"
reexamine_text = "The pigeonholes are full again. You are fairly sure now that Wren reads every one."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="StoryItems/LetterRack"]
shape = SubResource("RectangleShape2D_160x80")

