theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 16
text = "[E] Look at the letter rack"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="SealKit" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(40, -620)
script = ExtResource("6_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the side table"
flag_to_set = "wren_seal_kit_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]Wren's side table[/b]

Beside Wren's chair at the hearth: a tin of sealing wax in a dozen colours, a thin bone knife warming on the hearthstone, and a row of small brass seals. A merchant's mark. A chapter house's. One bears the crown's own lion, worn smooth with use.

Wren served the crown as an intelligencer once. She never gave the tools back."
reexamine_text = "The bone knife is still warm."

