[node name="CourierBook" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(220, -495)
script = ExtResource("6_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the courier book"
flag_to_set = "waystation_courier_log_read"
discovery_text = "[b]The courier book[/b]

Every rider who sleeps here signs Wren's book: name, from where, bound where. Two entries stand out.

A King's Ranger came west three nights ago, asking the road to Thornhaven and how many men the village keeps under arms.

And a Guild courier rides east every new moon, always the morning after a rider has come in from Thornhaven."
reexamine_text = "The courier book. A Guild rider east every new moon, a Thornhaven rider the night before."

