[node name="GameBoard" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-120, -560)
script = ExtResource("6_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the game board"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A game of fox and geese[/b]

A worn board sits on a stool by Wren's chair, mid-game. The fox is almost hemmed in, but not quite. Whoever plays the geese has been very patient.

Wren says she is waiting for one last game worth playing."
reexamine_text = "The fox has not moved. Neither have the geese."

